<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">engineering</span>
</div>
<div>
<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-body-md text-slate-900 font-semibold leading-tight">Direct Tooling Leadership</h3>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-slate-700">Immediate dialogue with senior toolroom engineers.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
